# A 32-bit element unpacked by `mov.b64 {x, y}, %rd` from a register a
# mov packed, `mov.b64 %rd, {a, b}`, is that element (PTX ISA §9.7.9.4),
# through a copy and with a sink, and the value its element register had
# at the pack. Unpacked from any other value v, element i of b bits is
# ⌊v/2^(i·b)⌋ mod 2^b: the lowest of four 16-bit elements of a pack of
# two, the low half of a 64-bit product, the high half of an unpacked
# element, 0 here, and the low half of a pack of an immediate wider than
# its 32 bits, 0, each store where the RTX 4090 run stores. An unpack
# after a join of two packs stays refused. A guarded pack is refused,
# and a guard on its element is a bound: the store it guards runs on at
# most the CTA's 64 threads, and the CTA's global store bytes are a
# bound.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/unpack.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd6], %r1; // global store [16·%tid.x + 512·%ctaid.x + param_0] sectors/req 16 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd8], %r1; // global store [16·%tid.x + param_1] sectors/req 16 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd4], %r1; // global store addr ? (%rd2 has more than one reaching definition){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd4], %r1; // global store [16·(%tid.x mod 16384) + param_0] sectors/req 16 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd4], %r1; // global store [16·(%tid.x mod 1073741824) + param_0] sectors/req 16 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd4], %r1; // global store [4·(⌊%tid.x/16384⌋ mod 65536) + param_0] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd4], %r1; // global store [param_0] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd7], %r1; // global store [param_0 + 64] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd4], %r2; // global store [16·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 16 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_unpack_guarded( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store <= 512 B; param load 512 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd4], %r1; // global store addr ? (%rd2 is written under a guard){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p2 st.global.u32 	[%rd1], %r1; // <= warp * × lane * | exec <= 64/CTA | global store [param_0] sectors/req <= 1 (ideal <= 1){{$}}
